#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuits are very small or shallow (often $\\leq 10-20$ gates),\n"
msgstr "Les circuits sont très petits ou peu profonds (souvent $\\leq 10-20$ portes),\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Noise models are simple and well-validated (for example, Pauli noise),\n"
msgstr "Les modèles de bruit sont simples et bien validés (par exemple, le bruit de Pauli),\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "High statistical cost is acceptable,\n"
msgstr "Un coût statistique élevé est acceptable,\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The goal is accuracy rather than throughput.\n"
msgstr "L'objectif est la précision plutôt que le débit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this reason, PEC is often applied to:\n"
msgstr "Pour cette raison, PEC est souvent appliquée à :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Isolated subcircuits within larger workflows,\n"
msgstr "Des sous-circuits isolés au sein de workflows plus vastes,\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Short-time evolution steps,\n"
msgstr "Des étapes d'évolution sur de courtes durées,\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "State preparation or measurement routines,\n"
msgstr "Des routines de préparation d'état ou de mesure,\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking and validation experiments.\n"
msgstr "Des expériences de benchmarking et de validation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM software stack (IBM Quantum Compute and error-mitigation tooling) reflects this by treating PEC as a specialized option, not a default mitigation layer.\n"
msgstr "La pile logicielle IBM (IBM Quantum Compute et les outils de mitigation d'erreurs) le reflète en traitant PEC comme une option spécialisée, et non comme une couche de mitigation par défaut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Typical PEC use cases include:\n"
msgstr "Les cas d'usage typiques de PEC comprennent :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-16
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Precision benchmarking of quantum hardware,\n"
msgstr "Benchmarking de précision du matériel quantique,\n"

